          "explanation": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><p>$\\hat{p}_1=5/100=0.05$, $\\hat{p}_2=3/100=0.03$, so $\\hat{p}_1-\\hat{p}_2=0.02$. The standard error is $\\sqrt{\\dfrac{0.05(0.95)}{100}+\\dfrac{0.03(0.97)}{100}}=\\sqrt{0.000475+0.000291}=\\sqrt{0.000766}=0.02768$. For a two-sided 90% interval $z_{\\alpha/2}=z_{0.05}=1.65$, so the margin is $1.65\\times 0.02768=0.0457$ and the interval is $0.02\\pm 0.0457=(-0.026,\\ 0.066)$.</p></div><div class=\"ml-vi\"><p>$\\hat{p}_1=5/100=0.05$, $\\hat{p}_2=3/100=0.03$, nên $\\hat{p}_1-\\hat{p}_2=0.02$. Sai số chuẩn là $\\sqrt{\\dfrac{0.05(0.95)}{100}+\\dfrac{0.03(0.97)}{100}}=\\sqrt{0.000475+0.000291}=\\sqrt{0.000766}=0.02768$. Khoảng tin cậy 90% hai phía dùng $z_{\\alpha/2}=z_{0.05}=1.65$, biên sai số $1.65\\times 0.02768=0.0457$ và khoảng là $0.02\\pm 0.0457=(-0.026,\\ 0.066)$.</p></div>"
