          "explanation": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><p>Point estimate $\\bar{x}_X-\\bar{x}_Y=19.4-15.1=4.3$. Standard error $=\\sqrt{\\dfrac{1.4^{2}}{35}+\\dfrac{0.8^{2}}{40}}=\\sqrt{0.056+0.016}=\\sqrt{0.072}=0.2683$. Using $t_{0.025,34}=2.032$ the margin is $0.545$, giving $(3.75,\\ 4.85)\\approx(3.8;\\ 4.8)$. The pooled route agrees: $s_p^{2}=\\dfrac{34(1.96)+39(0.64)}{73}=1.2548$, $SE=1.1202\\sqrt{\\tfrac{1}{35}+\\tfrac{1}{40}}=0.2593$, margin $=1.993\\times 0.2593=0.517$, giving $(3.78,\\ 4.82)$ — the same option.</p></div><div class=\"ml-vi\"><p>Ước lượng điểm $\\bar{x}_X-\\bar{x}_Y=19.4-15.1=4.3$. Sai số chuẩn $=\\sqrt{\\dfrac{1.4^{2}}{35}+\\dfrac{0.8^{2}}{40}}=\\sqrt{0.056+0.016}=\\sqrt{0.072}=0.2683$. Dùng $t_{0.025,34}=2.032$, biên sai số là $0.545$, cho $(3.75,\\ 4.85)\\approx(3.8;\\ 4.8)$. Cách gộp phương sai cũng cho kết quả tương tự: $s_p^{2}=\\dfrac{34(1.96)+39(0.64)}{73}=1.2548$, $SE=1.1202\\sqrt{\\tfrac{1}{35}+\\tfrac{1}{40}}=0.2593$, biên $=1.993\\times 0.2593=0.517$, cho $(3.78,\\ 4.82)$ — cùng một phương án.</p></div>"
